 "note": "Deep-sea jellyfish with a glowing heart. A living underwater lantern that stings drowned and guardians.",
 "ability_desc": "Underwater lantern and guard: once tamed, while it is in water (following or told to stay) it keeps one real LIGHT block lit at itself, placed waterlogged into a water source block so the water stays, and moved with it (light level 10 + bond). The old light is turned back into water on every move and on death, despawn, reload and Feather's cleanup. Every 2 s, while its owner is within 6 blocks, it stings drowned and guardians within 5 blocks of it (4 damage + Slowness II). Bond (0 -> 5): light 10 -> 15, sting 4 -> 6 damage, reach 5 -> 7 blocks.",
